  "description": "Nelly, a third-grade Cupid, is set to take the \"Eros Test\" held once every thousand years! Descended to the human world to pass the test, Nelly meets her human counterpart, Go Min-Beom, through a fateful accident(?). Nelly tries to find him his soulmate! However, this man... claims he's a \"voluntary\" eunuch and doesn't need one. To make matters worse, Nelly ends up shooting Go Min-Beom with an arrow of \"lust\" instead of \"love,\" and struggles to prevent herself from failing the test...!\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
